# Keyed-run template for the unleashed.systems cutover (`scripts/cutover.ts`), run from this host.
# The value lives in 1Password only: `env-exec request --template apps/landing/cloudflare-cutover.env.example -- …`.
# Token scope, a user token on this one account and the unleashed.systems zone only:
#   Account › Workers Scripts › Edit (custom domains have no per-Worker role, so it reaches every Worker);
#   Zone › Zone › Read; Zone › Single Redirect › Edit; Zone › DNS › Read; Zone › Zone Settings › Edit;
#   Zone › Zaraz › Read; Zone › Bot Management › Read; Zone › Workers Routes › Edit;
#   Zone › SSL and Certificates › Read.
# A TTL of hours, IP-filtered to the host that runs it, deleted after the cutover.
# op: import
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=op://Keyed-Runs/Cloudflare-Cutover/CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN
